---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="关于我们" description="关于资源分享站的介绍">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24">
    <article class="space-y-8">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12 animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-primary/30">
          <span class="text-4xl">📦</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-3">关于资源分享站</h1>
        <p class="text-text-muted">分享优质资源，助力学习成长</p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Mission -->
      <section class="card p-8 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">🎯</span>
          <span>我们的使命</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          资源分享站致力于收集和分享各类优质资源，包括绿化软件、影视动漫、PC工具、游戏资源和实用教程。我们相信知识和资源应该自由共享，帮助更多人提升自己，实现个人成长和价值。
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <!-- Categories -->
      <section class="card p-8 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-500">📁</span>
          <span>资源分类</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/20">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">💻</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-1">绿化软件</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-dim">免安装软件合集</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🎬</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-1">影视动漫</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-dim">高清影视资源</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🛠️</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-1">PC工具</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-dim">实用工具软件</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🎮</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-1">游戏相关</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-dim">游戏资源分享</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📚</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-1">实用教程</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-dim">学习教程分享</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🔗</div>
            <div class="font-semibold text-text-primary text-sm mb-1">外站导航</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-text-dim">优质网站推荐</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <!-- Disclaimer -->
      <section class="card p-8 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-500">⚠️</span>
          <span>免责声明</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-text-secondary">
          <p>•本站资源均来自互联网，仅供学习交流使用，版权归原作者所有。</p>
          <p>•下载后请在24小时内删除，请勿用于商业用途。</p>
          <p>•如有侵权，请联系我们删除相关内容。</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <!-- Contact -->
      <section class="card p-8 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/20 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">📧</span>
          <span>联系我们</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-4">
          如有任何问题或建议，欢迎随时联系我们！
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a href="mailto:contact@example.com" class="btn btn-primary">
            <span>📧</span>
            <span>发送邮件</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
